     "end": 18.257
    }
   ],
   "end": 19.007
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 19.007,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "That distance is called the moment arm.",
     "start": 19.007,
     "end": 21.378
    },
    {
     "text": "It is how far a joint is from the line where a weight pulls.",
     "start": 21.698,
     "end": 25.625
    },
    {
     "text": "We will call it the distance from the joint to the weight's pull.",
     "start": 25.945,
     "end": 28.85
    },
    {
     "text": "Longer is harder.",
     "start": 29.17,
     "end": 30.632
    },
    {
     "text": "Shorter is easier.",
     "start": 30.952,
     "end": 32.356
    }
   ],
   "end": 33.106
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 33.106,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "First, the biceps curl.",
